<title>USA: Cort Business Services Corp Q4 net rises.</title>
<headline>Cort Business Services Corp Q4 net rises.</headline>
<dateline>FAIRFAX, Va. 1997-02-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr			  $0.35		    $0.27</p>
<p> Net			  4,702		    3,164</p>
<p> Revs			62,665		   45,160</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  13,610		   11,608</p>
<p>		 YEAR</p>
<p> Shr			  $1.28		    $0.99</p>
<p> Net			 15,936		   11,529</p>
<p> Revs		     234,149		  179,309</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  12,448		   11,608</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)  </p>
<p>NOTE: 1995 results shown on a proforma basis and exclude interest expenses associated with subordinated debt and $50 million of senior notes.</p>
<p>Company conducted initial public offering December 31, 1995.</p>
<p>Actual 1995 results include a $4.1 million charge from the retirement of debt.</p>
<p>Q4 net income per share including charge: profit $0.35 vs loss $0.17.</p>
<p>Year net income per share including charge: profit $1.28 vs profit $0.55.</p>
</text>
